"s":235.78,"e":236.38,"line":88},{"w":"you","s":236.38,"e":236.58,"line":88},{"w":"go","s":236.58,"e":236.86,"line":88},{"w":"again...","s":236.86,"e":237.46,"line":88},{"w":"Tryin’","s":239,"e":239.98,"line":89},{"w":"to","s":239.98,"e":240.36,"line":89},{"w":"sound","s":240.36,"e":240.48,"line":89},{"w":"important.","s":240.48,"e":241.48,"line":89},{"w":"Ha.","s":244.18,"e":244.76,"line":90},{"w":"Almost","s":252.02,"e":253,"line":91},{"w":"had","s":253,"e":253.4,"line":91},{"w":"me.","s":253.4,"e":253.8,"line":91}],"lines":[{"s":0.672,"e":1.898,"text":"# You Almost Had Me"},{"s":2.24,"e":6.18,"text":"There you go again..."},{"s":6.18,"e":10.12,"text":"Talkin’ like a thought is a prophecy."},{"s":13.48,"e":14,"text":"Ha."},{"s":14,"e":26.86,"text":"You almost had me."},{"s":26.86,"e":27.36,"text":"**[Verse 1]**"},{"s":32.98,"e":35.18,"text":"Woke up, mind already makin’ a movie,"},{"s":35.54,"e":37.06,"text":"Worst-case scenes tryna shake and move me,"},{"s":37.06,"e":38.94,"text":"“You gon’ lose this, everybody sees through me,”"},{"s":38.94,"e":40.8,"text":"Old voice talkin’ like it ever really knew me."},{"s":40.8,"e":42.6,"text":"Used to grab every thought like evidence,"},{"s":42.6,"e":44.42,"text":"Give fear a throne, give doubt residence,"},{"s":44.42,"e":46.24,"text":"Now I watch that noise with intelligence—"},{"s":46.24,"e":48.18,"text":"Thought ain’t fact, that’s the difference."},{"s":48.18,"e":49.84,"text":"Here come anger with a match and gasoline,"},{"s":49.84,"e":51.88,"text":"Here come shame tryna edit what I’ve seen,"},{"s":51.84,"e":53.86,"text":"Here come fear dressed sharp, lookin’ evergreen,"},{"s":53.86,"e":55.88,"text":"But I caught that little hook before it got in me."},{"s":55.88,"e":56.38,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":55.88,"e":57.92,"text":"Oh, you wanted my pulse up,"},{"s":57.92,"e":59.18,"text":"Wanted my fists shut,"},{"s":59.18,"e":63.46,"text":"Wanted one bad thought to make my whole day fucked up—"},{"s":64.56,"e":67.1,"text":"Then I saw what you were doin’..."},{"s":67.86,"e":69.6,"text":"And I started laughin’."},{"s":69.6,"e":70.1,"text":"**[Chorus — huge melodic release]**"},{"s":69.6,"e":72.88,"text":"You almost had me, almost made me believe,"},{"s":72.92,"e":76.52,"text":"Almost turned a little thought to a life sentence on me,"},{"s":76.62,"e":80.18,"text":"But I saw you reachin’, saw the trick up your sleeve,"},{"s":80.18,"e":84.02,"text":"Now I’m laughin’ while you’re talkin’—you got nothin’ I need."},{"s":84.1,"e":87.74,"text":"You almost had me, almost stole my peace,"},{"s":87.74,"e":91.22,"text":"But the second I could see you, you got weaker to me,"},{"s":91.22,"e":95.06,"text":"You can scream, you can scheme, you can beg me to bleed—"},{"s":94.98,"e":98.72,"text":"You’re a thought, not a truth, you don’t get to be me."},{"s":98.72,"e":99.22,"text":"**[Post-Chorus]**"},{"s":99.32,"e":103.2,"text":"Ha—almost had me."},{"s":103.12,"e":103.86,"text":"Not today."},{"s":105.44,"e":106.06,"text":"Thought, not fact."},{"s":106.06,"e":107.08,"text":"Watch it fade."},{"s":107.08,"e":107.58,"text":"**[Verse 2 — drums hit harder]**"},{"s":107.18,"e":108.98,"text":"Now my mind throws bait and I notice the line,"},{"s":109.04,"e":110.84,"text":"“Get mad right now!” — nah, I’m takin’ my time,"},{"s":111,"e":112.64,"text":"“Everybody hates you!” — cute story, nice try,"},{"s":112.66,"e":114.46,"text":"I don’t gotta climb aboard every train passing by."},{"s":114.48,"e":116.3,"text":"I can feel what I feel without feeding the flame,"},{"s":116.36,"e":118.34,"text":"Name the emotion, don’t become its name,"},{"s":118.4,"e":120.2,"text":"Let the wave roll through, let it rise, let it change,"},{"s":120.38,"e":122.06,"text":"Wise mind at the wheel while the weather gets strange."},{"s":122.08,"e":123.84,"text":"See, peace ain’t never having darkness appear,"},{"s":123.84,"e":125.66,"text":"Peace is darkness knockin’ and me staying right here,"},{"s":125.66,"e":127.48,"text":"I can hear every threat that imagination declares"},{"s":127.48,"e":129.54,"text":"And still choose my next move instead of choosing my fear."},{"s":129.54,"e":130.04,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":129.66,"e":131.3,"text":"You wanted reaction,"},{"s":131.32,"e":132.56,"text":"Wanted distraction,"},{"s":132.68,"e":136.96,"text":"Wanted one assumption turned into an action,"},{"s":138,"e":140.44,"text":"But I caught you in the act and—"},{"s":140.46,"e":142.32,"text":"Damn, that’s kinda funny."},{"s":142.32,"e":142.82,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":142.8,"e":146.26,"text":"You almost had me, almost made me believe,"},{"s":146.4,"e":149.88,"text":"Almost turned a little thought to a life sentence on me,"},{"s":150.08,"e":153.4,"text":"But I saw you reachin’, saw the trick up your sleeve,"},{"s":153.4,"e":157.56,"text":"Now I’m laughin’ while you’re talkin’—you got nothin’ I need."},{"s":157.48,"e":161.06,"text":"You almost had me, almost stole my peace,"},{"s":161.06,"e":164.56,"text":"But the second I could see you, you got weaker to me,"},{"s":164.56,"e":168.14,"text":"You can scream, you can scheme, you can beg me to bleed—"},{"s":168.14,"e":172.06,"text":"You’re a thought, not a truth, you don’t get to be me."},{"s":173.06,"e":175.02,"text":"I don’t have to fight you."},{"s":175.24,"e":176.6,"text":"I don’t have to flee."},{"s":176.56,"e":178.3,"text":"I don’t have to prove you wrong"},{"s":178.3,"e":180.04,"text":"To keep you from controlling me."},{"s":180.04,"e":181.18,"text":"I can watch you."},{"s":181.2,"e":182.08,"text":"I can name you."},{"s":182.08,"e":183.96,"text":"I can smile and let you leave."},{"s":183.96,"e":185.64,"text":"Funny how the monster shrinks"},{"s":185.64,"e":188.9,"text":"The second that I see..."},{"s":188.9,"e":189.4,"text":"**[Beat Drop — near silence]**"},{"s":193.4,"e":194.3,"text":"Oh."},{"s":199.43,"e":203.2,"text":"You wanted a reaction."},{"s":206.44,"e":209.86,"text":"YOU ALMOST HAD ME—now I know what you do,"},{"s":209.86,"e":213.68,"text":"Take a maybe, make it misery, then masquerade as truth,"},{"s":213.68,"e":217.48,"text":"But I’m quicker with the distance, I’m deliberate with moves,"},{"s":217.48,"e":221.36,"text":"I can hear you without serving you—that’s freedom coming through."},{"s":221.36,"e":224.74,"text":"You almost had me, but my peace ain’t cheap,"},{"s":224.74,"e":228.42,"text":"I don’t wrestle every nightmare that comes crawling through my sleep,"},{"s":228.36,"e":232.04,"text":"Let it knock, let it talk, let it promise, let it plead—"},{"s":232.04,"e":233.8,"text":"I decide what gets my focus."},{"s":233.9,"e":235.72,"text":"I decide what I believe."},{"s":235.72,"e":236.22,"text":"**[Outro — piano only]**"},{"s":235.78,"e":237.46,"text":"There you go again..."},{"s":239,"e":241.48,"text":"Tryin’ to sound important."},{"s":244.18,"e":244.76,"text":"Ha."},{"s":252.02,"e":253.8,"text":"Almost had me."}],"duration":254.68,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-21T00:35:51.771Z","stats":{"whisperWords":659,"polishedWords":627,"matched":560,"matchRate":0.893}}